ets/enrollment/dms.mdx","Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida.",{"_65":251},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_39":253,"_46":58,"_41":254,"_52":255,"_61":-7,"_12":256,"_63":257},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_65":258},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_39":260,"_46":58,"_41":261,"_52":262,"_61":-7,"_12":263,"_63":264},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_65":265},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_39":267,"_46":58,"_41":268,"_52":269,"_61":-7,"_12":270,"_63":271},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_65":272},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_39":274,"_46":58,"_41":275,"_52":276,"_61":-7,"_12":277,"_63":278},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_65":279},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_39":281,"_46":58,"_41":282,"_52":283,"_61":-7,"_12":284,"_63":285},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference"